inl note_of_bend_backend_1 () = Note ("BEND-BACKEND", 1u32, "2026-10-14T10:39Z", "user", "2026-10-14 06:39 user decision: pack 2 (Bend 8/16-bit ints, char->int identity, plus upstream A4) holds until hopacsota; moved out of spiral_compiler.fs into C:\\Users\\i574n\\.claude\\jobs\\5a6e53fb\\tmp\\hold-until-hopacsota (bend_small_ints.ps1, upstream_a4.ps1, the CharT one-liner, bend-list-additions.txt with the 20 samples); source and Bend list (344) restored to the blessed state, Bend outputs regenerated at parity (single-flight-20261014-063836)")
