o the documented knock-ons (case->default relabel, (void)vN for a now-unused closure parameter, Gleam _v unused-parameter prefix, Delphi tmpN and Wasm $tN temp renumbering, blank-line placement); about 3,000 dead lines removed (C 1,199, Delphi 606, F# 535, Zig 554, Rust 298, TypeScript 96, Kotlin/Swift 46 each); gcc -O0 -c -Wall on the same 80-file sample: 48 warnings in 18 files -> 2 in 2 (-Wreturn-type gone, 2 dead stores the purity whitelist keeps); ladder single-flight-20261012-062458 / hopac-20261012-070019 / restore single-flight-20261012-080719: 3,768 rows each, 0 rows differ across cores or on restore (compile, residual hash, native, exit, stdout, oracle, baseline), DISAGREE 0; bless dev41 started 08:36 (main cache, then a reproduction pass); samples/string_ord joins the Wasm list (exit 0 like C, a $str_cmp forced to 0 exits 1); blessed dev41 2026-10-12 08:36 (single-flight-20261012-083637, 3,769 rows incl. the new string_ord Wasm row, agree 2,287, DISAGREE 0) with reproduction single-flight-20261012-090246: 0 of 3,769 rows differ, parity 3,769; 2026-10-12 compiler lane: Op.Dyn treated as pure, pureBlock/pureBranchingOp drop dead if/unbox/int-switch with pure branches; gcc -O0 -Wall set-but-unused over 464 main.c: 46 warnings in 12 files -> 31 in 2; remaining: folder_index_module macro let (won't fix: macro text opaque), omniledger runtime_native multi-destination let components (needs per-component rewrite) and single-variable chains kept live by something in the IR (next: IR dump); 2026-10-14 01:55 DeadPureLetElision now prunes dead components of multi-destination lets: a pure branching TyLet whose binder has some dead components keeps only the live ones in the binder and in every branch return (nested branch returns included), then re-elides the branches; mega_omniledger_erp_kernel/runtime_native gcc -O0 -Wall -Wextra warnings 29 -> 6; the 6 left are runtime_i64_add's raw C macro in the sample itself (opaque by design, like folder_index_module); outputs changed only on omniledger (F#, C, Rust, Delphi, Zig; native identical, stdout same); rung 1 single-flight-20261014-004129 clean; 2026-10-14 05:09 blessed with the Bend pack (single-flight-20261014-043715 reproduces rung 1, 0 of 4,094 differ); the pruning pass now elides each branch once (prune the unrewritten op, then rewrite) instead of twice, output-identical (proven by the bless reproduction); left: the two samples whose warnings come from their own raw C macros (folder_index_module, omniledger runtime_i64_add), opaque by design", TaskKind, P2, D3, 100u32, Done, "", "compiler,codegen", "current", "current")
