r the shared helpers move (core.ps1 into spiral or its own repo); step (1) and (3) can proceed independently; user decision 2026-10-12 19:05: once spiral no longer needs polyglot, split what remains into focused repos named for what they are and archive polyglot; 2026-10-13 22:59 the spiral-split gear splitter (scripts/gear-dev.ps1, bench-split.ps1, build-splitter.ps1, tmp/splitter, lanes/splitter) was removed at the user's request: idle since early October (234 runs Sep 26-Oct 1, then 21), built for gpt5parallel's 159k lines; use build.ps1 -Configuration Debug -CoreSource <copy> for candidates", Epic, P2, D6, 60u32, Active, "", "repos,polyglot", "current", "current")
