inl ebpf_c_profile () = Task ("EBPF-C-PROFILE", "eBPF as a profile of the C backend (verifier-friendly bounded loops, no recursion, BPF maps), started once the WASM, WGSL, Calyx, Kotlin, Swift and OpenQASM 3 backends are complete; 2026-10-10: codegenEbpf (--backend Ebpf / .ebpf). Windows gcc -std=c11 -O2 -w -x c runs it. No kernel load: the installed clang has no BPF target. Loops are for-loops capped at 16777216. Maps are a 64-slot array (spiral_map_lookup, spiral_map_update). Harness is the Kotlin 20 plus samples/ebpf_map, ebpf_map_full, ebpf_arith, ebpf_nested, ebpf_float, ebpf_conv, ebpf_unit, ebpf_shift, ebpf_bool, ebpf_cast, ebpf_div, ebpf_bits, ebpf_key, ebpf_umul, ebpf_neq, ebpf_facc, ebpf_uacc, ebpf_bacc, ebpf_char, ebpf_sh31, ebpf_flt, ebpf_minkey, ebpf_nest3, ebpf_uadd, ebpf_fdiv, ebpf_tacc, ebpf_t2, ebpf_ineq, ebpf_tworec, ebpf_t3, and ebpf_snot. single-flight-20261010-154804: 20 rows agree with C, DISAGREE 0 (backend_smoke exits 13, native_bitwise_scalar exits 42). hopac-20261010-155533: those 20 agree, DISAGREE 0. single-flight-20261010-155601 (rerun after hopac): agree 20, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_map stores 42 at key 7, overwrites it with 9, and looks up a missing key: single-flight-20261010-155757, hopac-20261010-155818, and single-flight-20261010-155823 agree with C, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_map_full fills 64 slots (including key -1 and a stored 0), rejects key 63, and overwrites a full map; samples/ebpf_arith checks toward-zero signed division and remainder, arithmetic right shift, and unsigned wrap. hopac-20261010-161118 and single-flight-20261010-161123 agree with C on those two, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_nested (self-tail with an inner while) and samples/ebpf_float: hopac-20261010-161541 and single-flight-20261010-161809 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_conv (INT32_MIN, casts, unsigned division of the high bit, logical shift, left at runtime) and samples/ebpf_unit (map update from a join point): single-flight-20261010-162410, hopac-20261010-162431, and single-flight-20261010-162437 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_shift (runtime shift counts: arithmetic right shift of a negative, left shift of a positive, unsigned left and right): single-flight-20261010-162550, hopac-20261010-162607, and single-flight-20261010-162612 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_bool (runtime bool arguments, &&, ||, inequality): single-flight-20261010-162736, hopac-20261010-162802, and single-flight-20261010-162807 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_cast (runtime i32, negative i32, and u32 to f32, and f32 to u32): single-flight-20261010-162924, hopac-20261010-162942, and single-flight-20261010-162948 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_div (negative signed divisor, and a runtime u32 divisor): single-flight-20261010-163012, hopac-20261010-163033, and single-flight-20261010-163039 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_bits (runtime u32 and, or, xor, and complement): single-flight-20261010-163054, hopac-20261010-163123, and single-flight-20261010-163128 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_key (a shifted i32 is the map key) and samples/ebpf_umul (unsigned multiply wrap): single-flight-20261010-163156, hopac-20261010-163216, and single-flight-20261010-163222 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_neq (runtime f32 negation, and <> as equality plus bool !=): single-flight-20261010-163335, hopac-20261010-163411, and single-flight-20261010-163417 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_facc (self-tail f32 accumulator, dead return 0.0f) and samples/ebpf_uacc (self-tail u32 accumulator, unsigned add wrap, dead return 0u): single-flight-20261010-163445, hopac-20261010-163459, and single-flight-20261010-163506 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. Combined reprove of those 17 Ebpf samples: hopac-20261010-163533 and single-flight-20261010-163544 agree 17, DISAGREE 0, every native exit 0. samples/ebpf_bacc (self-tail bool accumulator, dead return false) and samples/ebpf_char (runtime char equality, 'A' is 65; char fails the number constraint so < is rejected): single-flight-20261010-163634 for bacc, single-flight-20261010-163652 for char, then hopac-20261010-163736 and single-flight-20261010-163743 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_sh31 (u32 shift by 31 and by 0) and samples/ebpf_flt (negative f32 ordering): single-flight-20261010-163819, then the 21-sample hopac-20261010-163835 and single-flight-20261010-163848 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. That pair of runs also reproves the earlier 19 profile samples, agree 21, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_minkey (map key INT32_MIN) and samples/ebpf_nest3 (nested i32, u32, f32 flattened to one struct): single-flight-20261010-163933, hopac-20261010-163950, and single-flight-20261010-163957 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_uadd (u32 add across 2^31): single-flight-20261010-164046, hopac-20261010-164105, and single-flight-20261010-164111 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_fdiv (f32 division by a negative divisor): single-flight-20261010-164142, hopac-20261010-164203, and single-flight-20261010-164209 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_tacc (self-tail returning a pair, dead return (SpiralTuple0){0}): single-flight-20261010-164304, hopac-20261010-164320, and single-flight-20261010-164326 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_t2 (pair and triple in one program): single-flight-20261010-164419, hopac-20261010-164436, and single-flight-20261010-164442 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. Full harness reprove of all 47 Ebpf samples: hopac-20261010-164510 and single-flight-20261010-164532 agree 47, DISAGREE 0 (backend_smoke exits 13, native_bitwise_scalar exits 42). On-disk outputs are the single-flight-20261010-164532 generation. samples/ebpf_ineq (runtime NEQ on i32, u32, and f32, emitted as !=): single-flight-20261010-165107, hopac-20261010-165121, and single-flight-20261010-165152 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_tworec (two self-tail methods, +3 and -2, each with continue and dead return 0): single-flight-20261010-165227, hopac-20261010-165252, and single-flight-20261010-165321 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_t3 (self-tail returning a triple, live three fields, dead return (SpiralTuple0){0}): single-flight-20261010-165358, hopac-20261010-165414, and single-flight-20261010-165429 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. samples/ebpf_snot (complement of runtime -1i32 and -8i32): single-flight-20261010-165553, hopac-20261010-165558, and single-flight-20261010-165604 agree, exit 0, DISAGREE 0. Out of v1: f64, i64/u64, NaN/infinity, strings, unions, arrays, closures, heap refs, globals, failwith, non-self-tail recursion, a kernel verifier.", Feature, P2, D6, 65u32, Active, "WASM-BACKEND,WGSL-BACKEND,CALYX-BACKEND,KOTLIN-BACKEND,SWIFT-BACKEND,OPENQASM3-BACKEND", "backend,compiler", "current", "current")
