inl note_of_source_boundary_authority_11 () = Note ("SOURCE-BOUNDARY-AUTHORITY", 11u32, "2026-10-15T06:20Z", "lane-b", "02:20 lane B: pack-1g installed with --source-blocks; consumers LANDED (uncommitted): apps/zed/tasks/test-at-row.ps1 takes block spans from SpiralCompiler --source-blocks (refuses a DLL without the capability; smoke on the installed DLL: stream 38 definitions, row 15 selects the 6 tests that reach fold), apps/kino memo.ex program_blocks/compiled_part/statement_line heuristics removed in favour of new lib/spiral/kino/source_blocks.ex (one batched --source-blocks call per run; keys fall back to the whole source without the capability), memo_test 20 incl. compiler-boundary cases; no line heuristic left in these consumers (Kino's own spi_walk still serves stubbed runs only)")
