inl tibia_typed_rules () = Task ("TIBIA-TYPED-RULES", "Hunt subset of Canary's rules as Spiral modules in the apps/tibia package (grid and floors, creatures melee/ranged/flee, cooldown groups, HP/mana, potions, loot, death penalty); integer-only so CPU and WGSL traces are bit-identical; started 2026-10-12, all passing through run_notebook: geometry.spi (8 incl. prelude), vitality.spi (5, GADT typestate living/fallen), coins.spi (5, gold/platinum/crystal conservation), rng.spi (6, counter-based lowbias32 keyed by seed/tick/entity/purpose, reference values from an independent implementation), cooldowns.spi (6, spell groups plus own cooldown), hunt.spi (4, uses other modules via ///- --package .), hunt_sim.spi (6, deterministic 600-tick hunt, golden seed 7 = 7 kills/140 gold/69 health); every rules test lists ///> rust and ///> c (40 tests, 0 failures, 489 s full run 2026-10-12)", Feature, P1, D6, 70u32, Paused, "TIBIA,TEST-EXPECT-DIAGNOSTIC", "tibia,spiral,tests", "current", "current")
