inl gleam_js_target_gaps () = Task ("GLEAM-JS-TARGET-GAPS", "Gleam JavaScript target gaps (2026-10-12): spiral_halt (exit code 3 for the C oracle), erlangMath (log, exp, tanh, sqrt, sin, cos) and arrays/refs are Erlang-only; near_wallet uses none, so low priority; spiral_math_pow is already portable (float.power)", TaskKind, P2, D3, 10u32, Planned, "", "compiler,gleam,javascript", "current", "current")
