inl rust_global_granular () = Task ("RUST-GLOBAL-GRANULAR", "Ongoing: migrate rust_global blobs and giant one-liners to granular, domain-modeled Spiral, prioritizing GADTs / existentials / HKTs instead of phantomdata simulation (user 2026-10-06 11:55 'put some effort into reducing rust_global, migrating code to granular spiral etc, prioritizing gadts/existentials/hkts'; 2026-10-06 06:58 'granularize the code like before instead of stuffing rust macros everywhere'; 2026-10-08 10:25 'don't perpetuate eoie's drift (code inside rust_global, giant one liners)'); one round was done 10-06 (in-session task 69), the goal is standing: count rust_global sites per repo (spiral lib, apps, eoie, dice, alphabet) and drive the count down each session, migrating touched blobs first; user decision 2026-10-12 19:18: touched-blob rule (every change touching a rust_global blob migrates it) plus a per-repo count reported each session so it only goes down", Epic, P1, D6, 5u32, Active, "", "spiral,lib,domain-modeling", "current", "current")
