inl no_agree_reasons () = Task ("NO-AGREE-REASONS", "user decision 2026-10-13 07:15: no_agree is allowed only with a short reason, e.g. test x no_agree 'exception text' = (cell form ///- --no-agree with the reason); Kino rejects a bare no_agree and reports counts per reason in the run report so opt-outs cannot grow silently; migrate tonight's markers (base.try exception text, sm' format/format_debug/format_debug_2/format_exception native rendering, date_time_guid_from_date_time_2 implementation-defined offset); 2026-10-13 09:07 landed: test x no_agree \"reason\" = and ///- --test --no-agree \"reason\" round-trip (document.spi), bare no_agree fails the test without running, rows carry no_agree, report/spiral-tests lines count no_agree_reasons; 6 lib markers migrated (base try, sm' format/format_debug/format_debug_2/format_exception, date_time guid_2); notebook_report_test covers reason, bare rejection, counts, round trip; lib re-run pending; 2026-10-13 14:06 lib sweep reports no_agree_reasons: exception text is backend-specific=2, local UTC offset in year 1 is implementation-defined=1, tests each backend's native rendering=2", TaskKind, P2, D2, 100u32, Done, "", "kino,lib,agreement", "current", "current")
