inl note_of_eoie_one_call_spec_2 () = Note ("EOIE-ONE-CALL-SPEC", 2u32, "2026-10-15T10:50Z", "main-thread", "06:50 groom: eoie help on 10-15: 6 verbs (status, patch, agile, bundle, proxy, help), 17 distinct agile subverbs, 70 proxy capabilities (unchanged since 10-14 08:23). Spec runner still a pwsh prototype (lane-a one-call/run-spec.ps1); 0 of the red cases turned green tonight.")
inl hopacsota () = Task ("HOPACSOTA", "hopacsota: parallel core restarted from single-flight's evaluator, the Hopac way (fill-once cells, server-owned tables, local scheduler), determinism by construction, no record/replay; contract = spiral/apps/compiler/tmp/lanes/hopacsota/PLAN.md (decisions D1-D15, gates G1-G6, phases 0-7, scoreboard, decision-change log); gpt5parallel stays reference until Phase 6; user decision 2026-10-13 22:47, plan 2026-10-13 23:15", Epic, P0, D8, 15u32, Active, "", "compiler,hopacsota,parallel", "current", "current")
