inl note_of_eoie_agile_todos_1 () = Note ("EOIE-AGILE-TODOS", 1u32, "2026-10-16T02:11Z", "main-thread", "22:11 main: built. Crates agile_todo_model (Spiral-only domain package with 5 Tibia-style test blocks), agile_todo_lines (findings, 685 generated lines), agile_todo_paths (path verdicts, 387), agile_todo_scan (verb, 922); all under the 1,000-line gate. Git work trees are listed with git ls-files -co --exclude-standard -z, other dirs walked without following links; comment syntax per extension (11 families), string-quote parity, Spiral ///> ///- skipped, marker word boundary; skips counted by reason (nested, vendor, generated = file next to a same-stem .spi, syntax, binary, large > 1 MiB, links, unreadable). Inspection effect (no lease). On all 6 repos: 10,928 files, 3,124 scanned, 0 TODOs (the no-comments rule holds; the 4 spec hits were inside a markdown code fence), 11 s. Tests: model 5/5 and CLI notebook todo_cli.spi 3/3 (walk, git, json) through Kino; both registered in eoie_dev_spiral_tests. Kino change needed: a module's test cells now mount its package's own dependencies qualified (mounts.ex + kino.ex), memo fingerprints dependencies at their real path. Strict evidence renewal running.")
