inl note_of_ci_single_pipeline_1 () = Note ("CI-SINGLE-PIPELINE", 1u32, "2026-10-16T02:24Z", "main-thread", "22:24 main: done in the trees, not committed: spiral gh-pages.yml gains schedule (17 6 * * *) and workflow_dispatch (suite input) with a compiler job (ubuntu, 360 min, zig 0.17.0 added, oracle artifact) running scripts/workflow.ps1 -Compiler -Suite; the build job skips schedule; compiler.yml removed. eoie: eoie.yml removed, gh-pages.yml (ubuntu + windows, rust 1.88.0 + rustfmt, setup-beam, zig) runs scripts/workflow.ps1, whose init.ps1 clones spiral as a sibling the way dice clones polyglot and runs spiral init-app-build.ps1 + mix deps.get; the eoie.yml steps became Invoke-Block calls. polyglot gh-pages.yml gained setup-zig. Next: the user's commit, then the first runs.")
